      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "Flat event invitation with strong text, quiet icon, and tonal hover.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-event\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 10h16a8 8 0 0 1-16 0ZM8 3v3m4-3v3m4-3v3M6 21h12\"/></svg><b>A shared meal</b><small>Make room at the table. Shared meals have a way of starting connections.</small></button>",
      "css": ".ds-event{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;max-width:250px;padding:16px 14px;text-align:left;background:var(--surface,#eef3e7);color:var(--accent,#43274f);border:1px solid var(--line,#b7c6aa);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s}.ds-event b{color:var(--text,#35233d);font:800 13px/1.5 Manrope,sans-serif}.ds-event small{color:var(--muted,#536047);font:12px/1.7 Manrope,sans-serif}@media(hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){.ds-event:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--surface-soft,#dce9cc);border-color:var(--control-border,#748168)}}.ds-event:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#43274f);outline-offset:4px}.ds-event:disabled{opacity:.48;cursor:not-allowed}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-event{transition:none}}"
    }
