  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Neighborhood festival",
    "overview": "Kinarium uses the neighborhood festival as its shared visual world: broad plum fields, pale yellow invitations, mint surfaces, and substantial display lettering. It feels sociable and curious, with real house illustrations providing the detail and personality.\n\nThe user-approved expansion carries the landing hero’s identity through world screens, resident details, events, insights, creation and settings dialogs, the field guide, locked states, and administration. `src/client/festival-tokens.css` owns the shared fonts and palette; `theme.css` maps them to semantic interface roles; `app-chrome.css` applies the common navigation, controls, and surface treatments. `landing.css` retains the landing’s particular composition. Existing layouts, task behavior, and simulation artwork remain the foundation.",
